    "detailed_description": "A Deep Rest is a collection of short stories about men and their relationship with mental health and depression. Taking control of a different character in each story, you will experience life from their perspective. See the problems and issues they face and help them find ways to be alright again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In The Darkness Look For The Light</h2>You cannot have one without the other.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/dee4caa78d2b1cf84f7e44e5bb9b5d15.poster.avif?t=1707226747\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/dee4caa78d2b1cf84f7e44e5bb9b5d15.webm?t=1707226747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/dee4caa78d2b1cf84f7e44e5bb9b5d15.mp4?t=1707226747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore A Dark And Mysterious World</h2>The cave is calling for you, will you answer?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/182c80d279eabb838a314bee358c7119.poster.avif?t=1707226747\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/182c80d279eabb838a314bee358c7119.webm?t=1707226747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/182c80d279eabb838a314bee358c7119.mp4?t=1707226747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel The Stories Of These Men</h2>Every man has his story.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/5924789d0f562987e52eb2dfc022b4f3.poster.avif?t=1707226747\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/5924789d0f562987e52eb2dfc022b4f3.webm?t=1707226747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/5924789d0f562987e52eb2dfc022b4f3.mp4?t=1707226747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be Brave And Keep Going</h2>You've come this far, the only way is forward.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/bf193e271a360ad087d8dd7cc87568d2.poster.avif?t=1707226747\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/bf193e271a360ad087d8dd7cc87568d2.webm?t=1707226747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/bf193e271a360ad087d8dd7cc87568d2.mp4?t=1707226747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A slow and immersive experience focused on explorative storytelling.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four distinct and emotional short stories revolving around men and their relationship with mental health and depression</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A unique visual style with objects being drawn using white outlines in an otherwise dark world.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A personal game inspired by real events and emotions made by one person.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "A Deep Rest is a collection of short stories about men and their relationship with mental health and depression. Taking control of a different character in each story, you will experience life from their perspective. See the problems and issues they face and help them find ways to be alright again.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In The Darkness Look For The Light</h2>You cannot have one without the other.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/dee4caa78d2b1cf84f7e44e5bb9b5d15.poster.avif?t=1707226747\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/dee4caa78d2b1cf84f7e44e5bb9b5d15.webm?t=1707226747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/dee4caa78d2b1cf84f7e44e5bb9b5d15.mp4?t=1707226747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore A Dark And Mysterious World</h2>The cave is calling for you, will you answer?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/182c80d279eabb838a314bee358c7119.poster.avif?t=1707226747\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/182c80d279eabb838a314bee358c7119.webm?t=1707226747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/182c80d279eabb838a314bee358c7119.mp4?t=1707226747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel The Stories Of These Men</h2>Every man has his story.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2447830/extras/5924789